we want to build priority queue from scratch,
it could be based on "array" or "heap".
we will see heap later, so we implement it  by array.
(the queue is order item based on values, smallest is frontest)

Note: in the priority queue, enqueue is always O(n)
      because he need to sort the data!
      but dequeue should be O(1)
      but in our implementation, dequeue is O(n)
      because we use shiftLeft()
      (to make it O(1), we should use Cycle-Array)


Note: it is cristal clear
      when we want to shift a array to "right", we should start from "right" (end of the list)
      when we want to shift a array to "left" , we should strat from "left"  (beginning of the list)